        <key>roleRationale</key>
        <string>Use the genuine SC frame for the new top/middle/side role heights. Keep the native closed-omega below anchor and its actual optical centre. Extend the native top centre along its own italic axis. Place ogonek on the actual right-lobe baseline ink interval, and side at the new outer-right upper bowl. Native zero-coordinate roles are not treated as inactive; these are explicit new source positions requiring actual attachment/stack review.</string>
